<%= render "shared/errors", record: drawing_session %>
<%= form_with model: drawing_session.persisted? ? drawing_session : [drawing_session.venue, drawing_session] do |form| %>
  <p><%= form.label :name %><br><%= form.text_field :name, required: true, maxlength: 100 %></p>
  <p><%= form.label :custom_slug, "Slug" %><br><%= form.text_field :custom_slug, maxlength: 100, placeholder: drawing_session.name.to_s.to_url %><br>
    <small>Leave blank to generate from the session name. Previous links keep working when the slug changes. <% if drawing_session.persisted? %>Current link: <%= link_to drawing_session_url(drawing_session), drawing_session_path(drawing_session) %>.<% end %></small>
  </p>
  <p>Venue: <%= link_to drawing_session.venue.name, venue_path(drawing_session.venue) %></p>
  <p><%= form.label :time_zone, "Time zone" %><br><%= form.select :time_zone, DrawingSession::TIME_ZONES, {}, required: true %></p>
  <p><%= form.label :start_time, "Regular start time" %><br><%= form.time_field :start_time, required: true, step: 60 %><br>
    <small>Usual event start in the session's time zone. Use Manage Schedule to change a single date.</small>
  </p>
  <p><%= form.label :model_pay, "Model pay (USD)" %><br><%= form.number_field :model_pay, min: 0, step: "0.01", required: true %></p>
  <p><%= form.label :booking_horizon_months, "Booking horizon (months)" %><br><%= form.number_field :booking_horizon_months, min: 1, required: true %></p>
  <fieldset>
    <legend>Available Weekdays</legend>
    <%= hidden_field_tag "drawing_session[available_weekdays][]", "" %>
    <% Date::DAYNAMES.each_with_index do |day, index| %>
      <label><%= check_box_tag "drawing_session[available_weekdays][]", index, drawing_session.available_weekdays.include?(index.to_s), id: "weekday-#{index}" %> <%= day %></label>
    <% end %>
  </fieldset>
  <fieldset>
    <legend>Prevent Consecutive Models by Gender</legend>
    <p>Each selected gender cannot repeat in immediately adjacent scheduled sessions. Unselected genders may repeat. An unbooked session breaks the sequence; closed dates are skipped.</p>
    <%= hidden_field_tag "drawing_session[no_consecutive_genders][]", "" %>
    <% User::GENDERS.each do |gender| %>
      <label><%= check_box_tag "drawing_session[no_consecutive_genders][]", gender, drawing_session.no_consecutive_genders.include?(gender), id: "no-consecutive-#{gender}" %> <%= gender.capitalize %></label>
    <% end %>
    <p>These rules apply to new bookings and replacements, not existing reservations. Organizers can explicitly override with an explanation.</p>
  </fieldset>
  <p><%= form.label :instructions %><br><%= form.text_area :instructions, maxlength: 5000, rows: 4 %></p>
  <p>Changing the regular start time moves upcoming bookings that do not have a dated time exception, retaining each time change. Other settings do not rewrite existing bookings. Automated reminders are not available yet.</p>
  <%= form.submit drawing_session.persisted? ? "Save Session" : "Create Session" %>
<% end %>
